... WHO PREVAILS?</li>\n<li>WHEN ALL SEEMS LOST, TEH EPIK DUCK WILL TAKE MORE</li>\n<li>WHEN THE MOON RISES, SO DOES THE EPIK DUCK....</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902165856\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 47/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 58/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019435/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.236      1 Template:NPC\n100.00%   48.236      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2831-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902165856 and revision id 15662. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Finlay Island","exists":true},{"title":"Resource Hub","exists":true}],"images":["Crazy_Man.png"]}
